{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Controls how strictly a test store checks pending events when observation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"finishes."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/SQ","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/SH","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/off","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/strict"],"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TestExhaustivity"}],"modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterTesting"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","remoteSource":{"fileName":"TestExhaustivity.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/InnoSquadCorp\/InnoRouter\/blob\/5.2.1\/Sources\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity.swift#L25"},"externalID":"s:17InnoRouterTesting16TestExhaustivityO","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TestExhaustivity"}],"symbolKind":"enum","title":"TestExhaustivity"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting"]]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"InnoRouter’s test stores follow TCA’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TestStore"},{"type":"text","text":" exhaustivity model:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events collected from the underlying authority’s unified "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callback accumulate in an internal queue. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" call dequeues the next event and asserts a predicate. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".strict"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the store reports events left pending at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deallocation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"assertNoPendingEvents()"},{"type":"text","text":" is a non-terminal checkpoint: it reports and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumes the current pending snapshot, then continues observing. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closes the queue, consumes its final snapshot, and reports the first event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emitted after that boundary in both exhaustivity modes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Testing currently attributes issues recorded inside an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"isolated "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deinit"},{"type":"text","text":" to an "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unknown test"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rather than to the test that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owned the store, which makes a deinit-time leftover-event failure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hard to locate. Until that is resolved upstream, await all work and end"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each test with an explicit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":". It runs the strict check with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller’s source location and disarms the deinit-time fallback."}]}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui/documentation/InnoRouterTesting/TestExhaustivity/off":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"off"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The test store still delivers events through "},{"code":"receive(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", but pending"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events at "},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or deallocation are silently discarded. Explicit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assertions and events emitted after "},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" still report issues."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Useful for incremental migrations of large legacy suites."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/off","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity\/off","title":"TestExhaustivity.off","type":"topic"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui/documentation/InnoRouterTesting/TestExhaustivity/strict":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"strict"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every observed event must be drained through "},{"code":"receive(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or deallocation. Pending events fail the test. This is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default and matches TCA’s "},{"code":"exhaustive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" semantics."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/strict","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity\/strict","title":"TestExhaustivity.strict","type":"topic"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui/documentation/InnoRouterTesting/TestExhaustivity":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity","url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Controls how strictly a test store checks pending events when observation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"finishes."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"TestExhaustivity","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui/documentation/InnoRouterTesting/TestExhaustivity/Equatable-Implementations":{"title":"Equatable Implementations","role":"collectionGroup","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity\/equatable-implementations","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/Equatable-Implementations","kind":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui/documentation/InnoRouterTesting":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting","title":"InnoRouterTesting","type":"topic"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui/SQ":{"title":"Swift.Equatable","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/SQ","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui/SH":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Hashable","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/SH"}}}